<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26225" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφοιτάω</span></b> , 
			Aeol.
		
		part.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζαφοίταισ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					25.15
				</span></i>
			:—<i>wander, roam,</i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.60
			</span></i>; <i>go backwards and forw ards,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				186
			</span></i>; of hounds on the scent, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				3.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. διὰ τῆς χώρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					557
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀν᾽ ἐρῆμον δρίος</span> prob.
			in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lyr.Alex.Adesp.</u>
				7.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τῆς Ἰταλίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Caes.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			: c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφοιτῶντες [τὸ ζεῦγμα]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Im.</u>
					2.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰμωγὴ δ. τὸν στρατόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Her.</u>
					19.12
				</span></i>
			; of a report, <i>spread,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς Π̔ώμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Fab.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				1.4.8
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>permeate,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχὴ διαπεφοιτηκυῖα</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σώματος</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				1.1.4
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				8.54
			</span></i>; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δημιουργὸς] τῆς ὅλης [τῆς ὕλης]
					διαπεφοιτηκώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					4.561
				</span></i>
			.</div>
